  m_Name: Prompt_5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  PromptDialogue: "Oh yeah? Electric Cars are so great right? Do you even know where
    electricity comes from? Burning fossil fuel! Checkmate tree-hugger, I\u2019d
    rather drive my truck, Electric Car companies just want me to spend more money
    and make them rich."
  correctCardName: ShockingTruth
  correctCardSelected: "Hmm\u2026 I guess I never really thought about how the energy
    grid is changing. If we\u2019re moving toward more wind and solar, then electric
    cars could actually make a difference. Maybe they\u2019re not as bad as I thought."
  incorrectCardSelected: "That doesn't make sense at all. You clearly don\u2019t
    understand how all of this really works."
